Recommends: avahi-daemon, libnss-mdns, deskflow | input-leap
Suggests: openssh-client
Description: LAN-only dual-machine workstation and distributed compute agent
 GOLEM LINK pairs two computers on the same local network and unifies them:
 one dashboard, live hardware telemetry, distributed task scheduling with
 explicit node permissions, and checksummed resumable file transfers.
 .
 There is no cloud account, no master node and no telemetry. Pairing requires
 a six-digit code compared by a human on both machines. File shares are opt-in
 and never default to a full drive.
